      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "HASTINGS.\nThe Duke of Lancaster and Westmoreland;\nAgainst the Welsh, himself and Harry Monmouth;\nBut who is substituted ’gainst the French\nI have no certain notice.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
